  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\HcFamilyTree\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/GenealogyService.php:11 OCP\\IDBConnection::lastInsertId(): deprecated since Nextcloud 21; use \\OCP\\DB\\QueryBuilder\\IQueryBuilder::getLastInsertId",
        "lib/Service/ResearchImportService.php:45 OCP\\IDBConnection::lastInsertId(): deprecated since Nextcloud 21; use \\OCP\\DB\\QueryBuilder\\IQueryBuilder::getLastInsertId"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 uses in 2 files of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 35. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
